    {
      "subId": "200806",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Komore Teahouse",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "20080301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "20080301": {
            "id": "20080301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How strange... It's never this quiet here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080302"
            ]
          },
          "20080302": {
            "id": "20080302",
            "speakerId": 3009,
            "speakerName": "Taroumaru",
            "text": "Woof, woof... woof!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080303"
            ]
          },
          "20080303": {
            "id": "20080303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Thoma's playing his ventriloquist game again, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080304"
            ]
          },
          "20080304": {
            "id": "20080304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Thoma... Thoma...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080305"
            ]
          },
          "20080305": {
            "id": "20080305",
            "speakerId": 3009,
            "speakerName": "Taroumaru",
            "text": "Woof! Woof! ...Woof!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080306"
            ]
          },
          "20080306": {
            "id": "20080306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, you can come out now... Paimon's seen you already...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080307"
            ]
          },
          "20080307": {
            "id": "20080307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, not a peep... Ugh, so where the heck is he, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080308"
            ]
          },
          "20080308": {
            "id": "20080308",
            "speakerId": 3009,
            "speakerName": "Taroumaru",
            "text": "Woof, woof, woof! Woof!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080309"
            ]
          },
          "20080309": {
            "id": "20080309",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What's got Taroumaru so worked up today? He's always such a good boy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080310"
            ]
          },
          "20080310": {
            "id": "20080310",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "Hello, have either of you seen Thoma?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080311"
            ]
          },
          "20080311": {
            "id": "20080311",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No, we thought he'd be with you! Why, has something happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080312"
            ]
          },
          "20080312": {
            "id": "20080312",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "Then it's as I feared... On the way here, I heard that Thoma had been taken away by the Tenryou Commission.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080313"
            ]
          },
          "20080313": {
            "id": "20080313",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "I wasn't certain whether it was true, so I came right here. The fact that he hasn't arrived here as we arranged suggests that it is true.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080314"
            ]
          },
          "20080314": {
            "id": "20080314",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "The Raiden Shogun is holding a Vision Hunt Ceremony at the Statue of the Omnipresent God today, to mark the 100th Vision seized under the decree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080315"
            ]
          },
          "20080315": {
            "id": "20080315",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "And the 100th Vision bearer in question... the one who will have their Vision seized, I fear... is Thoma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080316"
            ]
          },
          "20080316": {
            "id": "20080316",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hold up a second... So the ceremony that Thoma said the Tenryou Commission were busy preparing for... that was this Vision Hunt Ceremony? And he was the target all along?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080317"
            ]
          },
          "20080317": {
            "id": "20080317",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "...I believe so. The shogun and the Tenryou Commission see the ceremony as a milestone. With the 100th Vision, they wish to mark the success of the Vision Hunt Decree to date.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080318"
            ]
          },
          "20080318": {
            "id": "20080318",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "...This cannot happen. I must go and rescue him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080319"
            ]
          },
          "20080319": {
            "id": "20080319",
            "speakerId": 3009,
            "speakerName": "Taroumaru",
            "text": "Woof, woof! Woof!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080320"
            ]
          },
          "20080320": {
            "id": "20080320",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Stay calm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080321"
            ]
          },
          "20080321": {
            "id": "20080321",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But you are the Shirasagi Himegimi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080322"
            ]
          },
          "20080322": {
            "id": "20080322",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! Like it or not, you represent the whole Yashiro Commission. So if you go and pull a stunt like that, you're basically declaring you and the Raiden Shogun are enemies now, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080323"
            ]
          },
          "20080323": {
            "id": "20080323",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And by doing it so publicly, you might be implicating a lot of other people from the Yashiro Commission, too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080324"
            ]
          },
          "20080324": {
            "id": "20080324",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "There is no other option... I must act with haste — the ceremony is about to begin. I will not abandon Thoma like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080325"
            ]
          },
          "20080325": {
            "id": "20080325",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "He is my friend! To think that not long ago, we were... all eating hotpot together...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080326"
            ]
          },
          "20080326": {
            "id": "20080326",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He is my friend, too. I will save him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080327"
            ]
          },
          "20080327": {
            "id": "20080327",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080328"
            ]
          },
          "20080328": {
            "id": "20080328",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You said it yourself. No time to delay.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080329"
            ]
          },
          "20080329": {
            "id": "20080329",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080330"
            ]
          },
          "20080330": {
            "id": "20080330",
            "speakerId": 1013,
            "speakerName": "Kamisato Ayaka",
            "text": "...Okay, I'll... wait here for your return. Get back safely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "20080331"
            ]
          },
          "20080331": {
            "id": "20080331",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't worry, Ayaka. A friend's life is on the line — we ain't about to mess this up!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
